JACL Adventure Creation Language v4.0

Building from source
--------------------

    cd src
    ./configure
    make install

If the configure script does not exist, generate it with:

    autoconf

The configure script will detect your platform and available libraries,
then build the appropriate interpreters. Binaries are placed in the 'bin'
directory.

Optional dependencies:
  ncurses  - Required for 'jacl' (GlkTerm console interpreter)
  libfcgi  - Required for 'fcgijacl' (FastCGI web interpreter)

If these are not found, those interpreters will be skipped.

Quick start
-----------

For a quick-start look at some of the games included with this distribution,
change into the 'bin' directory and type, for example:
'./jacl ../projects/grail.jacl'

For instructions and installation information see the appropriate chapter
in the Author's Guide (guide/installation.html).
